      "description": "Normal: 2-36 s (15 s timer + 30 s scrape, measured 24 h on 2026-11-12). Seconds since nvidia-gpu-metrics.sh (15 s timer on bumblebee) last rewrote /tmp/node_exporter/nvidia_gpu.prom. If nvidia-smi fails the script KEEPS the old file, node_exporter keeps serving its last values and every graph freezes at plausible numbers. Red here = the other panels are stale.",
